<task id="084" project="customer-provisioning-orchestration-r1">
  <metadata>
    <title>Author canonical secret-catalog manifest + generator (single source generates seeder + Configure + tokens.md + Bicep KV secret set)</title>
    <phase>H KV Federation Full Remediation</phase>
    <gate>cleared</gate>
    <status>completed</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Task tags include 'auth','azure-deployment'; introduces single-source-of-truth for KV secrets governing every customer environment; a bug here creates 4-way drift across seeder/Configure/tokens.md/Bicep. FR-36 acceptance scope.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>opus</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Manifest generator authored per project CLAUDE.md model-tier defaults (Opus/Fable for Phase H canonical secret-catalog manifest generator); requires reasoning across seeder script + Configure script + tokens.md + Bicep to design a single YAML schema that fans out cleanly to all 4. High-blast-radius.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>xhigh</effort>
    <parallel-group>none</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>true</parallel-safe>
    <deps>018, 019, 020</deps>
    <tags>auth, azure-deployment, dataverse</tags>
    <estimated-effort>8-12 hours</estimated-effort>
